WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:29.990 --> 01:31.130
[My Journey to You]

01:31.150 --> 01:34.060
[Episode 6]

01:42.660 --> 01:43.740
In that case,

01:43.740 --> 01:45.390
I'll check again.

02:12.390 --> 02:13.310
A triangle mark

02:13.700 --> 02:15.700
is used to leave a signal for allies.

02:16.220 --> 02:17.680
It indicates a direction,

02:18.150 --> 02:19.810
or where something is hidden.

02:38.540 --> 02:41.270
Young Master Yuanzhi, sorry to keep you waiting.

02:42.300 --> 02:43.430
What's in your hand?

02:46.060 --> 02:47.270
Nothing special.

02:48.970 --> 02:49.670
Let me see.

03:12.780 --> 03:14.140
My brother never wears

03:14.140 --> 03:16.140
such a golden and flashy accessory.

03:24.780 --> 03:27.710
I just want to make Young Master Shangjue happy.

03:28.600 --> 03:30.640
I don't know if something like this

03:30.670 --> 03:31.820
will make my brother happy.

03:31.820 --> 03:33.260
But if I don't send you to him

03:33.260 --> 03:34.690
before dark,

03:35.690 --> 03:36.810
he must be unhappy.

03:58.300 --> 04:00.960
A union of fish and water in broad daylight!

04:02.210 --> 04:04.140
That's not how you use that phrase.

04:04.320 --> 04:06.120
What a beautiful couple!

04:06.540 --> 04:08.330
I actually feel a little sad.

04:08.940 --> 04:10.000
How should I put it?

04:10.640 --> 04:12.970
It's like when I have to let my adult son go.

04:13.220 --> 04:15.230
I think you're taking advantage of Sword Wielder.

04:15.230 --> 04:16.220
What are you talking about?

04:16.220 --> 04:17.149
He's my brother.

04:17.180 --> 04:19.779
No matter how handsome he is, we can't be together.

04:19.779 --> 04:21.779
My sister doesn't filter her words.

04:22.140 --> 04:23.110
Don't mind her.

04:25.160 --> 04:25.780
However,

04:25.840 --> 04:27.440
she's a kind and nice person.

04:31.580 --> 04:32.230
Miss Yun?

04:36.340 --> 04:38.340
Eldest Young Miss has a good personality.

04:38.340 --> 04:39.400
She's not arrogant

04:39.560 --> 04:41.000
and is friendly towards others.

04:41.000 --> 04:42.860
I also like listening to her talk.

04:43.140 --> 04:44.270
Then you're doomed.

04:44.300 --> 04:47.159
She'll annoy you to death if she sets her eyes on you.

04:48.380 --> 04:50.380
It's a narrow road ahead. Follow me.

05:10.620 --> 05:13.620
You must be wondering why there are so few people here.

05:13.700 --> 05:15.380
Young Master Yuanzhi, you're amazing.

05:15.380 --> 05:17.040
You can read people's hearts.

05:17.370 --> 05:18.700
My brother likes peace.

05:19.130 --> 05:20.130
Unless summoned,

05:20.260 --> 05:22.700
the servants usually won't show up on their own.

05:22.700 --> 05:23.290
I see.

05:24.120 --> 05:26.130
Is Young Master Shangjue in the main hall?

05:26.130 --> 05:27.430
Should I...

05:28.880 --> 05:29.680
Why the hurry?

05:31.220 --> 05:32.260
I'm new here.

05:32.380 --> 05:34.840
I should greet Young Master Shangjue first.

05:35.220 --> 05:36.340
I should honor

05:36.590 --> 05:37.790
the basic etiquette.

05:38.460 --> 05:39.990
Brother treats you so well.

05:41.220 --> 05:42.700
He was worried that you would be neglected

05:42.700 --> 05:43.960
in the Ladies' Hostel.

05:44.200 --> 05:46.659
So he asked me to bring you here ahead of time.

05:47.260 --> 05:49.380
I've never seen him

05:49.840 --> 05:51.100
care so much for a girl.

05:52.350 --> 05:54.290
He won't blame you

05:54.520 --> 05:56.250
if you greet him a little later.

05:57.550 --> 05:59.120
I'm grateful

05:59.740 --> 06:01.190
for his kindness.

06:01.710 --> 06:04.040
As such, I must further uphold my manners.

06:04.660 --> 06:06.090
Why do you stop me?

06:07.850 --> 06:09.040
I'm just curious.

06:10.060 --> 06:11.980
What kind of charm do you have

06:12.820 --> 06:15.380
to make my brother fall for you all of a sudden

06:15.750 --> 06:17.250
and choose to marry you?

06:19.610 --> 06:21.870
Pretty women can coax people

06:23.620 --> 06:24.920
and fool people.

06:28.250 --> 06:30.450
You're too kind, Young Master Yuanzhi.

06:32.220 --> 06:34.310
Young Master Shangjue had already sent someone

06:34.310 --> 06:36.640
to check on Yun Weishan and my background.

06:40.240 --> 06:41.620
Their method of investigation

06:41.620 --> 06:42.790
is different

06:43.250 --> 06:44.110
from my method.

06:55.290 --> 06:56.090
What is this?

06:56.630 --> 06:59.030
Didn't you say I can read people's hearts?

07:00.310 --> 07:02.370
Then, let me have a good read of yours.

07:11.010 --> 07:12.270
You know martial arts?

07:14.750 --> 07:16.120
I never said I can't.

07:19.540 --> 07:20.530
Are you scared?

07:21.490 --> 07:23.620
I'm not afraid of your investigation.

07:23.770 --> 07:25.440
I'm just afraid of insects.

07:25.590 --> 07:27.360
Leave the insect on your palm.

07:28.190 --> 07:28.800
If you lie,

07:30.820 --> 07:31.540
its venomous fangs

07:31.540 --> 07:34.340
will pierce into your skin mercilessly.

07:35.140 --> 07:36.340
In two hours,

07:37.090 --> 07:39.330
your intestines and organs will rot.

07:40.920 --> 07:41.580
Do you dare?

07:45.900 --> 07:46.659
You dare not.

07:53.020 --> 07:55.150
My feelings for Young Master Shangjue

07:55.409 --> 07:56.790
are sincere

07:57.670 --> 07:58.630
and genuine.

08:00.310 --> 08:01.770
Even if you don't trust me,

08:02.350 --> 08:04.030
you should trust

08:04.580 --> 08:06.580
Young Master Shangjue's judgment.

08:11.660 --> 08:12.540
You're right.

08:13.780 --> 08:15.180
We have a long time ahead.

08:22.160 --> 08:23.800
What is this impressive bug?

08:24.310 --> 08:26.170
It can tell that someone's lying?

08:27.830 --> 08:28.580
I lied to you.

08:28.940 --> 08:30.870
It's just a medicinal ingredient.

08:31.600 --> 08:32.460
In this world,

08:32.990 --> 08:35.960
there's nothing that can really read people's hearts.

08:35.960 --> 08:36.760
If there were,

08:37.179 --> 08:39.309
it would have been destroyed long ago.

08:40.659 --> 08:42.190
Shouldn't it be treasured?

08:42.419 --> 08:43.880
How could it be destroyed?

08:46.210 --> 08:47.290
People always say

08:47.940 --> 08:49.470
they are chasing the truth.

08:50.140 --> 08:52.400
But they are always running away from it.

08:54.740 --> 08:57.000
People always say they despise secrets.

08:59.220 --> 09:01.030
But everyone has secrets.

09:06.410 --> 09:07.940
Even the abyss has a bottom,

09:07.940 --> 09:09.980
but the human heart will always be unpredictable.

09:09.980 --> 09:11.130
The human heart

09:11.700 --> 09:12.580
is the most

09:12.980 --> 09:15.130
vulnerable thing in the world.

09:16.940 --> 09:19.010
Can I go see Young Master Shangjue now?

09:19.010 --> 09:21.270
My brother doesn't meet guests at night.

09:21.820 --> 09:23.950
Let me take you to the guest room first.

09:24.150 --> 09:25.920
The servants will send the dinner

09:25.920 --> 09:27.150
to your room later.

09:31.290 --> 09:33.150
Thank you, Young Master Yuanzhi.

10:20.760 --> 10:23.180
♫The memories you saw in your dream♫

10:24.100 --> 10:25.200
♫Shone bright♫

10:26.060 --> 10:27.100
♫In the rain♫

10:28.510 --> 10:31.160
♫I set time into a chess game♫

10:31.980 --> 10:34.080
♫Waiting for you♫

10:36.250 --> 10:39.020
♫Every encounter is good luck♫

10:40.150 --> 10:42.790
♫Every farewell is a regret♫

10:44.010 --> 10:48.890
♫Fate is waiting to be written by the blade♫

10:51.730 --> 10:54.500
♫The traces you left in the dream♫

10:55.200 --> 10:56.330
♫It's like a riddle♫

10:57.070 --> 10:58.220
♫There's no answer♫

10:59.460 --> 11:02.080
♫I sewed winter clothes with memories♫

11:02.890 --> 11:04.120
♫Every needle♫

11:04.370 --> 11:06.360
♫Reminds me of you♫

11:07.250 --> 11:10.150
♫Suddenly I forget the world♫

11:11.120 --> 11:14.180
♫I hold your hand and worry about your lack of clothing♫

11:14.910 --> 11:21.250
♫Without regret, the fallen do not give up on the world♫

11:21.440 --> 11:24.260
♫I cross mountains and rivers to run towards you♫

11:24.590 --> 11:26.200
♫To find you♫

11:26.620 --> 11:29.000
♫And embrace your heart♫

11:29.300 --> 11:31.670
♫I don't care about their reminder♫

11:32.410 --> 11:36.140
♫I grip tightly to the blade♫

11:36.930 --> 11:39.770
♫Let this sharp blade be the brush♫

11:40.120 --> 11:41.810
♫To carve in my heart♫

11:42.060 --> 11:44.640
♫You and me♫

11:44.920 --> 11:51.680
♫A world only for us♫

12:13.130 --> 12:13.610
You...

12:19.100 --> 12:20.160
What are you doing?

12:34.700 --> 12:35.960
Young Master Yuanzhi.

12:37.900 --> 12:38.960
What are you doing?

12:40.060 --> 12:41.530
My concealed weapon pouch is missing.

12:41.530 --> 12:43.050
What does that have to do with me?

12:43.050 --> 12:44.050
Of course it does.

12:45.100 --> 12:46.190
Search carefully.

12:50.340 --> 12:51.140
Gong Yuanzhi.

12:52.340 --> 12:53.800
This is against the rules.

12:53.830 --> 12:54.690
Don't be guilty

12:54.870 --> 12:55.930
if you didn't do it.

12:56.460 --> 12:57.120
Otherwise,

12:57.570 --> 12:58.700
you're suspicious.

12:59.040 --> 13:00.170
I'm not suspicious.

13:01.920 --> 13:03.150
But I have dignity.

13:04.400 --> 13:05.730
Young Master Shangjue.

13:09.760 --> 13:11.090
Young Master Shangjue.

13:12.230 --> 13:12.760
Brother.

13:16.920 --> 13:17.800
What happened?

13:18.770 --> 13:21.690
Young Master Yuanzhi lost his concealed weapon pouch

13:21.690 --> 13:23.290
and wanted to search my room.

13:25.410 --> 13:25.810
You...

13:27.610 --> 13:28.140
Brother.

13:29.120 --> 13:30.570
When I went to pick up Shangguan Qian,

13:30.570 --> 13:32.520
the concealed weapon pouch was still on my waist.

13:32.520 --> 13:33.740
But now it's gone.

13:35.100 --> 13:36.340
Back at the Ladies' Hostel's courtyard,

13:36.340 --> 13:37.520
she suddenly fell down

13:37.520 --> 13:39.180
and held my waist for support.

13:39.590 --> 13:40.990
I didn't react back then.

13:41.080 --> 13:42.480
Now that I think about it,

13:42.820 --> 13:43.910
she must have stolen my pouch

13:43.910 --> 13:45.420
at that moment.

13:45.620 --> 13:47.700
Why would I steal your concealed weapon pouch?

13:47.700 --> 13:49.360
I don't even know how to use it.

13:50.030 --> 13:50.560
Brother.

13:51.330 --> 13:52.220
My concealed weapons

13:52.220 --> 13:53.820
are different from the ones

13:53.820 --> 13:54.880
sold by the Gong residence.

13:54.880 --> 13:57.140
The structure and poison used are completely different.

13:57.140 --> 13:58.800
If someone were to study them,

13:59.390 --> 14:02.120
the power and secrets of these concealed weapons

14:02.180 --> 14:03.180
would be exposed.

14:05.800 --> 14:08.270
Miss Shangguan, have you been out of this room

14:08.270 --> 14:09.470
since arriving here?

14:09.870 --> 14:10.400
No.

14:12.460 --> 14:13.970
The food was sent in.

14:14.070 --> 14:15.530
The servants can testify.

14:19.820 --> 14:20.750
Keep searching.

14:21.500 --> 14:22.220
Yes.

14:36.340 --> 14:37.240
Young Master Shangjue.

14:37.240 --> 14:38.220
Young Master Yuanzhi.

14:38.220 --> 14:40.620
We didn't find the concealed weapon pouch.

14:43.060 --> 14:44.100
It must be on her.

14:48.080 --> 14:50.740
Young Master Shangjue, did you really choose me

14:52.460 --> 14:54.220
because you wanted to marry me?

14:55.650 --> 14:56.990
I am the daughter

14:57.360 --> 14:59.360
of an upright and righteous family.

15:03.700 --> 15:05.140
Brother, trust me.

15:05.980 --> 15:07.310
It's definitely on her.

15:10.870 --> 15:11.800
Miss Shangguan,

15:12.850 --> 15:13.660
I’m sorry.

15:20.590 --> 15:21.250
Search her.

15:32.510 --> 15:33.070
Found it.

15:50.940 --> 15:52.000
This is not the one.

15:52.460 --> 15:54.450
It shouldn't be a jade pendant in the pouch either.

15:54.450 --> 15:56.050
It was her last time.
Enough.

16:01.560 --> 16:02.190
Brother.

16:05.070 --> 16:05.690
Young Master Yuanzhi.

16:05.690 --> 16:06.950
Lord Sword Wielder found your concealed weapon pouch

16:06.950 --> 16:07.860
by the river.

16:09.190 --> 16:10.410
I went to the Zhi Lineage earlier.

16:10.410 --> 16:12.140
The servants said you are here.

16:12.220 --> 16:13.100
Lord Sword Wielder told me

16:13.100 --> 16:14.760
to deliver it to you in person.

16:19.270 --> 16:20.640
If you refer to Gong Ziyu as

16:20.640 --> 16:22.620
Lord Sword Wielder in front of me again,

16:22.620 --> 16:24.220
I'll cut off your tongue

16:24.220 --> 16:25.750
and make medicine out of it.

16:28.160 --> 16:28.690
Leave us.

16:29.460 --> 16:30.010
Yes.

16:39.980 --> 16:40.980
Brother Yuanzhi.

16:42.470 --> 16:44.170
Apologize to Miss Shangguan.

16:47.980 --> 16:48.510
Brother.

16:48.980 --> 16:49.360
I...

17:03.330 --> 17:04.260
Miss Shangguan,

17:07.500 --> 17:08.390
I wronged you.

17:10.140 --> 17:10.680
Sorry.

17:32.930 --> 17:34.730
You don't have to return it to me.

17:34.960 --> 17:37.110
This was originally my gift to you.

17:42.600 --> 17:44.000
I've always wanted to ask

17:45.020 --> 17:46.350
where this jade pendant

17:47.180 --> 17:47.880
came from.

17:49.460 --> 17:51.160
You don’t remember?

17:52.730 --> 17:53.830
This jade pendant

17:54.260 --> 17:55.270
belongs to you.

17:58.090 --> 17:59.260
Of course I remember

17:59.900 --> 18:01.160
about my jade pendant.

18:02.510 --> 18:03.490
I'm asking about

18:04.280 --> 18:05.320
where you got

18:05.880 --> 18:06.940
this jade pendant.

18:40.020 --> 18:40.550
Brother.

18:41.410 --> 18:43.190
You know my concealed weapon pouch won't...

18:43.190 --> 18:45.310
Won't easily fall off.

18:47.200 --> 18:48.490
But as you saw,

18:49.510 --> 18:51.310
you can't do anything about her.

18:51.670 --> 18:52.940
Even if I trust you,

18:53.710 --> 18:55.330
no one will believe you.

18:56.930 --> 18:57.520
Brother,

18:59.180 --> 19:00.320
you lost

19:02.030 --> 19:03.160
that round just now.

19:07.330 --> 19:08.250
I was careless.

19:10.400 --> 19:12.530
Do you know what tool lions use to hunt?

19:15.330 --> 19:16.930
Their sharp claws and fangs?

19:17.140 --> 19:17.700
No.

19:20.220 --> 19:21.860
Teamwork?

19:22.420 --> 19:23.330
It's patience.

19:25.270 --> 19:25.940
Patience?

19:28.740 --> 19:31.000
When a lion is not completely certain,

19:31.700 --> 19:33.090
it lies in the grass

19:33.990 --> 19:35.520
and stays as still as a rock.

19:36.860 --> 19:38.490
It never acts rashly.

19:40.500 --> 19:42.630
Otherwise, once the cows are alarmed,

19:43.070 --> 19:45.130
it will not be able to catch anything.

19:46.140 --> 19:47.220
If a lion

19:47.330 --> 19:49.390
were as reckless as you were just now,

19:49.590 --> 19:51.090
it'd starve for the day.

19:52.460 --> 19:53.440
What's worse,

19:55.260 --> 19:57.790
this lion may be isolated by other lions

19:58.740 --> 20:00.200
and eventually be exiled.

20:01.540 --> 20:02.270
Understood.

20:02.620 --> 20:03.160
Brother.

20:06.620 --> 20:07.950
What do you understand?

20:10.220 --> 20:12.960
Things are much more complicated than I thought.

20:14.410 --> 20:16.470
And more interesting than I thought.

20:20.460 --> 20:21.060
By the way,

20:21.980 --> 20:22.830
go back and

20:22.980 --> 20:25.380
check the concealed weapons in your pouch.

20:26.140 --> 20:27.380
If I'm not mistaken,

20:28.400 --> 20:30.530
someone must have tampered with them.

20:32.570 --> 20:33.070
Brother,

20:33.070 --> 20:34.130
you mean...

20:35.490 --> 20:37.090
There is someone from Wufeng

20:38.850 --> 20:40.850
still hiding in the Gong residence.

21:36.730 --> 21:37.790
Young Master Ziyu.

21:43.080 --> 21:44.410
You dropped something.

21:46.060 --> 21:46.890
Young Master Yuanzhi.

21:46.890 --> 21:47.810
Lord Sword Wielder found your

21:47.810 --> 21:49.870
concealed weapon pouch by the river.

22:34.040 --> 22:36.120
Sister Zishang gave me this pastry.

22:36.220 --> 22:37.430
It's really delicious.

22:37.430 --> 22:38.450
I'll give you this.

22:38.450 --> 22:40.980
Can you show me your little butterfly?

22:40.330 --> 22:44.050
♫Will I see you again?♫

22:40.980 --> 22:42.030
No.

22:43.130 --> 22:44.070
Father said

22:44.220 --> 22:45.460
we are brothers.

22:45.460 --> 22:46.220
Brothers

22:46.220 --> 22:48.590
must give each other the best things.

22:47.020 --> 22:50.110
♫The summer we spent together is a blur now♫

22:48.850 --> 22:51.180
I don't want to be brothers with a bastard.

22:51.690 --> 22:53.060
I'm not a bastard!

22:53.060 --> 22:54.460
You are!

22:53.680 --> 22:57.360
♫Night breezes tousled your gray hair♫

23:00.270 --> 23:03.600
♫You looked at me in silence♫

23:02.900 --> 23:03.780
Mother.

23:03.960 --> 23:05.050
They said I...

23:05.200 --> 23:06.510
They said I'm...

23:06.210 --> 23:11.610
♫When you put your hands on my shoulders♫

23:08.160 --> 23:10.330
How can a boy cry so easily?

23:13.190 --> 23:17.710
♫All my fear and hesitation were gone♫

23:13.730 --> 23:15.390
How many times have I told you?

23:16.050 --> 23:17.580
Remember to go to the clinic

23:19.020 --> 23:20.280
when you're injured.

23:19.490 --> 23:24.770
♫Snow falls, my wounds would never close♫

23:20.780 --> 23:22.250
I don't want to go to Zhi Lineage.

23:22.250 --> 23:24.170
Gong Yuanzhi called me a bastard.

23:24.530 --> 23:26.280
I don't want to play with him.

23:26.450 --> 23:30.770
♫I've been adrift for too long but now I'm home♫

23:35.290 --> 23:35.950
Mother!

23:38.040 --> 23:38.910
Mother!

23:46.830 --> 23:47.950
Who made you cry?

23:48.530 --> 23:50.390
Father will punish him severely.

23:50.860 --> 23:53.630
Father, why is Mother ignoring me?

23:55.260 --> 23:55.910
Well,

23:57.180 --> 23:58.640
I can't help you with that.

23:59.180 --> 24:00.310
Because your mother

24:03.060 --> 24:03.960
is ignoring me too.

24:03.780 --> 24:06.990
♫Yesterday fades like a distant mountain♫

24:10.020 --> 24:12.490
♫Tears are the snow♫

24:13.820 --> 24:15.350
♫On the top of the mountain♫

24:35.250 --> 24:36.970
You don’t remember?

24:38.150 --> 24:39.150
This jade pendant

24:40.130 --> 24:41.020
belongs to you.

24:41.690 --> 24:42.940
Of course I remember

24:41.750 --> 24:46.060
♫You whisper loving words in my ear♫

24:43.570 --> 24:44.830
about my jade pendant.

24:46.180 --> 24:47.230
I'm asking about

24:47.860 --> 24:49.090
where you got

24:48.620 --> 24:53.520
♫Yet we have no choice but to part♫

24:49.240 --> 24:50.320
this jade pendant.

24:53.680 --> 24:55.320
Miss, aren't you cold here?

24:55.700 --> 25:01.770
♫I hold the blade in my hand♫

24:56.010 --> 24:57.420
I'll take you to a warm place.

24:57.420 --> 24:58.380
Let go of me!

24:58.480 --> 24:59.390
Let go of me!

24:59.460 --> 25:00.420
Help!

25:00.540 --> 25:01.340
Go!

25:01.790 --> 25:06.920
♫And slice through the night♫

25:01.940 --> 25:02.710
Who are you?

25:08.850 --> 25:12.270
♫Feelings are always so bland on paper♫

25:12.720 --> 25:15.450
♫But writing it feels so bitter and intolerable♫

25:15.800 --> 25:19.370
♫I mock people who are obsessed with love and hate♫

25:19.670 --> 25:22.520
♫But only half my heart remains♫

25:22.840 --> 25:26.860
♫Only I looked up when we crossed paths♫

25:27.250 --> 25:29.050
♫Leaving a moment behind♫

25:27.930 --> 25:29.730
Four years ago, during the Lantern Festival,

25:29.730 --> 25:34.220
♫At the shore of the flow of time♫

25:30.310 --> 25:31.770
I ran into thugs on the way.

25:32.990 --> 25:34.390
Young Master Shangjue, you

25:34.250 --> 25:36.400
♫I heard a door open♫

25:35.200 --> 25:36.440
happened to pass by and rescued me.

25:36.440 --> 25:39.620
♫The later the night, the warmer the heart♫

25:38.060 --> 25:38.990
You dropped this

25:39.900 --> 25:41.410
back then.

25:40.120 --> 25:43.880
♫Yet the hug feels colder than the snow♫

25:44.570 --> 25:46.720
I've always wanted to repay you for saving my life.

25:44.710 --> 25:49.990
♫Why do we stand side by side?♫

25:47.210 --> 25:48.210
You don't have to.

25:50.050 --> 25:52.280
I was just dealing with people who were in my way.

25:52.280 --> 25:54.140
I did not intentionally save you.

25:55.350 --> 25:56.810
It was just a coincidence.

25:57.300 --> 25:58.970
Don’t worry about it.

25:59.260 --> 26:01.330
Even if you didn't intend to save me,

26:02.450 --> 26:03.750
in my opinion,

26:05.920 --> 26:09.250
you protected my dignity, which is most important to a lady.

26:09.670 --> 26:11.930
As such, my heart already belongs to you.

26:13.630 --> 26:14.370
In the past,

26:15.420 --> 26:16.820
I dared not dream about it

26:17.700 --> 26:19.700
due to the difference in our status.

26:20.830 --> 26:22.260
I didn't expect

26:24.020 --> 26:26.040
to be able to marry you now.

26:26.400 --> 26:27.530
We're only engaged.

26:29.860 --> 26:31.390
The Gong residence is huge.

26:31.900 --> 26:33.030
Don't wander about.

26:34.460 --> 26:36.750
Stay where you belong,

26:37.620 --> 26:38.870
in the right place.

26:41.620 --> 26:43.080
Don't take the wrong path.

26:44.810 --> 26:46.430
I'll listen to you.

27:27.680 --> 27:28.260
Miss Yun.

27:34.230 --> 27:35.960
It's late. Why are you still up?

27:37.460 --> 27:38.990
Aren't you still up too?

27:45.910 --> 27:48.240
Are you not used to sleeping in a new place?

27:49.260 --> 27:50.020
Shall I ask the servants

27:50.020 --> 27:52.420
to prepare some soothing medicine for you?

27:56.890 --> 27:58.950
Did I say something wrong?

28:01.950 --> 28:03.710
You can't sleep either,

28:04.460 --> 28:07.920
but you worry about getting soothing medicine for me instead.

28:15.830 --> 28:17.470
Did I say something wrong?

28:21.450 --> 28:21.900
No.

28:23.010 --> 28:24.670
I just moved to a new place too.

28:26.060 --> 28:28.190
They said I'm already a Sword Wielder.

28:29.380 --> 28:31.780
So they moved me into my brother's old room.

28:31.780 --> 28:32.630
Lord Sword Wielder.

28:32.630 --> 28:35.160
These are the former young master's clothes.

28:39.650 --> 28:40.620
The room

28:43.140 --> 28:45.000
is filled with traces of his past.

28:47.290 --> 28:49.490
The decoration hasn't changed either.

28:51.260 --> 28:52.260
It's like

28:55.530 --> 28:57.390
he never left.

29:01.180 --> 29:02.310
It's almost winter.

29:02.650 --> 29:03.710
It's cold at night.

29:04.260 --> 29:05.920
But your face is full of sweat.

29:07.850 --> 29:09.250
Did you have a nightmare?

29:17.970 --> 29:19.830
Why aren't you wiping your sweat?

29:20.420 --> 29:21.540
Looks like

29:21.780 --> 29:23.380
you're used to being served.

29:24.490 --> 29:27.020
Did others wipe your sweat for you in the past?

29:28.840 --> 29:29.440
No.

29:34.600 --> 29:35.690
Except my mother.

29:38.050 --> 29:38.720
My mother

29:39.860 --> 29:41.040
would wipe my sweat,

29:43.220 --> 29:44.950
but she wouldn't wipe my tears.

29:47.780 --> 29:48.850
Did you cry a lot

29:49.190 --> 29:50.320
when you were young?

29:52.560 --> 29:54.490
We all have things we're sad about.

29:56.700 --> 29:57.890
But my mother told me

29:58.980 --> 30:00.120
a man shouldn't cry.

30:01.320 --> 30:02.410
So later,

30:03.110 --> 30:04.310
I stopped crying.

30:07.060 --> 30:07.960
I used to

30:08.920 --> 30:10.450
often have nightmares too.

30:11.940 --> 30:13.390
When I couldn't sleep,

30:15.060 --> 30:17.060
my younger sister would sing for me.

30:26.070 --> 30:31.400
♫The sun rises in the east and sets in the west♫

30:33.410 --> 30:38.880
♫Our parents call us home for dinner♫

30:40.810 --> 30:47.290
♫We grew up together♫

30:48.220 --> 30:53.760
♫We never wake up from our sweet dreams♫

30:54.560 --> 31:01.410
♫Spring brews life, and Winter brews coldness♫

31:02.000 --> 31:08.920
♫You're always in my thoughts♫

31:09.480 --> 31:16.750
♫Summer is long, and Autumn is brief♫

31:17.740 --> 31:23.330
♫I hope we can reunite again♫

31:29.780 --> 31:31.780
As long as I listened to her singing,

31:34.950 --> 31:36.820
I stopped having nightmares.

31:38.700 --> 31:40.340
You and your younger sister

31:41.140 --> 31:42.200
must be very close.

31:45.980 --> 31:47.250
You left Lixi Town

31:48.230 --> 31:49.960
and came to the Gong residence.

31:52.460 --> 31:53.990
She must miss you very much.

32:23.680 --> 32:24.280
Thank you.

32:27.970 --> 32:28.650
For what?

32:31.360 --> 32:32.290
I didn't answer.

32:34.100 --> 32:35.410
You didn't ask again.

32:40.300 --> 32:41.080
Sometimes,

32:42.430 --> 32:43.360
giving no answer

32:44.660 --> 32:45.710
is also an answer.

32:57.390 --> 32:59.450
I always wanted to return this to you,

32:59.570 --> 33:01.370
but I didn't find the right time.

33:03.220 --> 33:04.290
This ornament.

33:05.020 --> 33:07.150
I saw you hang it on yourself every day.

33:07.880 --> 33:09.770
It must be something you cherish.

33:12.540 --> 33:12.950
Yes.

33:15.220 --> 33:16.480
My father gave it to me.

33:19.740 --> 33:21.670
My father used to be a businessman.

33:21.860 --> 33:23.920
He had also seen all kinds of leather.

33:25.500 --> 33:26.700
This fox fur

33:26.960 --> 33:28.050
has a pure color

33:28.710 --> 33:30.240
and a symmetrical pattern.

33:31.050 --> 33:32.760
The fox fur is the finest.

33:34.180 --> 33:35.580
Your father must have put

33:35.590 --> 33:37.540
a lot of effort into finding it.

33:44.400 --> 33:45.530
My father

33:46.540 --> 33:48.140
had always been meticulous.

33:48.330 --> 33:49.590
He had his intentions.

33:51.900 --> 33:52.460
But

33:54.570 --> 33:55.830
I'm young and shallow.

33:57.620 --> 33:59.220
I've never understood them.

34:03.180 --> 34:04.780
At the age of 30, people stand firm.

34:04.780 --> 34:06.910
At the age of 40, people have no doubts.

34:07.520 --> 34:09.420
Sword Wielder, you're still young.

34:09.420 --> 34:11.420
How can you see everything clearly?

34:15.199 --> 34:17.300
Why did you call me Sword Wielder again?

34:17.300 --> 34:18.929
Didn't I ask you to call me Young Master Ziyu

34:18.929 --> 34:19.969
in private?

34:23.380 --> 34:24.300
Then

34:25.340 --> 34:27.070
don't call me Miss Yun anymore.

34:28.260 --> 34:28.780
Okay.

34:29.820 --> 34:31.080
What should I call you?

34:45.850 --> 34:47.050
Why don't you answer?

34:48.690 --> 34:49.520
Sometimes,

34:50.699 --> 34:51.630
giving no answer

34:52.380 --> 34:53.719
is already an answer.

35:14.020 --> 35:15.120
You're amazing.

35:15.820 --> 35:17.290
All Gong Ziyu thinks about

35:18.100 --> 35:19.550
is you.

35:20.840 --> 35:22.690
But I'll still fail him.

35:24.620 --> 35:25.550
You'll fail him.

35:28.060 --> 35:29.590
You'll destroy his life

35:30.020 --> 35:31.350
completely.

35:33.200 --> 35:36.130
When there are rivers of blood in the Gong residence,

35:36.410 --> 35:37.890
I really want to see

35:38.420 --> 35:40.080
how Gong Ziyu will look at you.

36:30.300 --> 36:32.430
When will Gong Ziyu go to the back hill?

36:35.080 --> 36:35.830
Soon.

36:36.260 --> 36:37.180
I'll try to ask.

36:39.460 --> 36:40.580
Your task

36:40.580 --> 36:42.640
is to draw a map of the Gong residence,

36:43.080 --> 36:43.580
right?

36:52.520 --> 36:53.550
For a long time,

36:53.650 --> 36:56.960
only Gong, Shang, Jue, Zhi, and Yu have been known in the martial world.

36:56.960 --> 36:57.890
I've never heard

36:58.490 --> 36:59.700
of the back hill.

37:00.950 --> 37:02.190
It's so mysterious.

37:03.380 --> 37:04.840
I asked several servants,

37:05.380 --> 37:07.110
but they said they didn't know.

37:08.010 --> 37:10.740
If you can find out the situation of the back hill,

37:11.140 --> 37:12.790
Hanya Si will be very happy.

37:14.560 --> 37:15.880
I don't need you to tell me.

37:15.880 --> 37:17.740
I'll definitely investigate it.

37:18.580 --> 37:20.370
The back hill is an important place.

37:20.370 --> 37:21.970
It's not easy to enter there.

37:22.900 --> 37:24.290
I have a way to trail him.

37:25.500 --> 37:26.220
How?

37:29.100 --> 37:30.910
There are just several tracking methods

37:30.910 --> 37:32.000
in the Wufeng.

37:33.500 --> 37:35.160
Make inferences from traces.

37:36.000 --> 37:37.400
Tail people in disguise.

37:38.260 --> 37:39.590
Predict destinations.

37:40.000 --> 37:41.050
Change shifts.

37:43.620 --> 37:44.190
Yes.

37:44.960 --> 37:46.360
There is another method.

37:46.890 --> 37:47.920
Scent tracking.

37:51.620 --> 37:52.460
But

37:52.530 --> 37:55.010
scent tracking is the hardest one.

37:55.820 --> 37:57.210
Why haven't I heard

37:57.610 --> 37:59.540
people at the Chi level can do this?

38:01.860 --> 38:04.860
There are many things you don't know about the Wufeng.

38:08.300 --> 38:08.780
Fine.

38:09.770 --> 38:10.620
Good luck.

38:12.180 --> 38:12.780
Thank you.

38:16.980 --> 38:18.670
Shouldn't you thank me too?

38:28.650 --> 38:29.830
You're so bold.

38:30.740 --> 38:31.830
Only risky moves

38:32.180 --> 38:34.240
can bring people back from the brink.

38:34.300 --> 38:35.300
Did you gain a lot?

38:35.670 --> 38:36.400
It's enough.

38:36.680 --> 38:37.610
Enough for what?

38:38.370 --> 38:40.700
It's enough for me to survive half a month.

38:41.300 --> 38:42.160
What about you?

38:42.650 --> 38:44.180
I'm not worried about this.

38:45.460 --> 38:46.720
What I'm worried about

38:47.090 --> 38:48.820
is how we can go out

38:49.940 --> 38:51.280
after half a month.

38:59.030 --> 39:00.430
Are you telling me or not?

39:00.940 --> 39:02.340
Are you telling me or not?

39:08.900 --> 39:09.810
Everyone knows

39:09.940 --> 39:12.340
the Trial of the Three Realms is dangerous.

39:12.340 --> 39:13.420
You know something about it.

39:13.420 --> 39:14.620
Why don't you tell me?

39:15.080 --> 39:17.140
Are you still my Green Jade Guardian?

39:19.020 --> 39:20.150
Lord Sword Wielder.

39:20.660 --> 39:21.770
I've sworn

39:22.260 --> 39:25.060
that I won't mention anything about the back hill.

39:26.340 --> 39:27.340
Don't force me.

39:38.410 --> 39:40.440
[Gong Residence, Back Hill]

39:39.360 --> 39:41.540
Recently, there has been a lot of explosions in the Shang Lineage in the front hill.

39:41.540 --> 39:43.060
At first, I thought people from the Wufeng stormed in.

39:43.060 --> 39:43.860
Later it turned out

39:43.860 --> 39:46.170
that Eldest Young Miss Gong ZiShang was doing research.

39:46.170 --> 39:47.570
It was just a false alarm.

39:47.590 --> 39:48.900
What research was she doing?

39:48.900 --> 39:49.630
I don't know.

39:49.860 --> 39:50.630
She seemed to

39:50.790 --> 39:52.590
combine gunpowder and weapons.

39:52.700 --> 39:53.690
Isn't it a hidden weapon

39:53.690 --> 39:55.750
made by Young Master Yuanzhi before?

39:56.820 --> 39:57.670
Interesting.

39:58.910 --> 40:00.440
I'm going to the front hill.

40:07.870 --> 40:08.470
Forget it.

40:09.310 --> 40:10.470
You don't want to tell me.

40:10.470 --> 40:11.870
I can't force you to do it.

40:12.340 --> 40:13.670
You don't want to leave.

40:14.010 --> 40:15.340
I can't break your legs.

40:18.490 --> 40:19.220
When I leave,

40:19.880 --> 40:23.080
remember to keep an eye on Gong Shangjue and Gong Yuanzhi.

40:26.720 --> 40:27.850
Lord Sword Wielder.

40:28.290 --> 40:29.490
Please be careful.

40:30.580 --> 40:32.140
Don't act tough.

40:32.140 --> 40:32.810
You...

40:33.980 --> 40:35.970
You refused to tell me, but you look like you want to say something.

40:35.970 --> 40:37.300
Why are you so annoying?

40:39.060 --> 40:39.990
It was nothing.

40:40.460 --> 40:41.520
After hearing what you said,

40:41.520 --> 40:42.520
I'm more nervous.

40:45.380 --> 40:46.510
Lord Sword Wielder.

40:51.070 --> 40:52.600
What's this? It's so heavy.

40:53.020 --> 40:54.480
Miss Yun is so thoughtful.

40:54.620 --> 40:56.620
She's already packed your luggage.

41:00.690 --> 41:02.090
I heard from Guardian Jin

41:02.660 --> 41:03.380
that

41:03.480 --> 41:06.580
you can leave the back hill only after completing the first trial.

41:06.580 --> 41:08.240
The back hill is damp and cold.

41:08.820 --> 41:09.950
Sister Zishang said

41:10.050 --> 41:11.850
you've been afraid of cold since childhood.

41:11.850 --> 41:14.540
So I brought some warm clothes.

41:17.100 --> 41:18.360
There's also alcohol.

41:19.180 --> 41:20.110
Unfortunately,

41:20.720 --> 41:22.050
I'll go alone this time.

41:22.740 --> 41:24.820
Some heartless people won't go with me.

41:24.820 --> 41:25.390
It seems

41:25.700 --> 41:27.230
that I can only drink alone.

41:31.240 --> 41:32.900
This is not ordinary alcohol.

41:33.500 --> 41:34.850
The back hill has a heavy miasma

41:34.850 --> 41:35.910
and high humidity.

41:36.390 --> 41:38.750
Miss Shangguan had cold in her body before.

41:38.750 --> 41:40.770
A physician in the clinic gave her a prescription.

41:40.770 --> 41:42.930
I made the medicinal alcohol according to it.

41:42.930 --> 41:44.530
It can prevent cold and damp.

41:44.560 --> 41:45.970
There're also some cakes.

41:45.970 --> 41:48.770
I'm afraid you won't like the food in the back hill.

41:51.060 --> 41:51.710
By the way,

41:53.490 --> 41:54.880
I made a pouch.

41:55.360 --> 41:58.020
The herbs inside are for repelling mosquitoes.

41:58.260 --> 42:00.770
My hometown Lixi Town was built along a river.

42:00.770 --> 42:03.460
There are many snakes, insects, mosquitoes, and ants there.

42:03.460 --> 42:04.460
When I was a child,

42:04.610 --> 42:07.070
my mother always asked me to carry it with me.

42:09.960 --> 42:11.490
Here is the Gong residence.

42:12.060 --> 42:15.120
No snake, insect, mosquito, and ant can get close to me.

42:22.500 --> 42:23.370
It doesn't matter.

42:23.370 --> 42:24.460
You've already made it.

42:24.460 --> 42:25.190
I'll take it.

42:29.460 --> 42:30.120
Look at you.

42:30.380 --> 42:31.460
You just came to the Gong residence.

42:31.460 --> 42:33.150
You prepared so many things.

42:33.610 --> 42:34.610
You must be tired.

42:35.190 --> 42:36.790
After my father passed away,

42:36.990 --> 42:39.110
the situation in my family changed.

42:39.740 --> 42:41.830
Many servants were dismissed.

42:42.380 --> 42:43.600
I'm used to working.

42:43.930 --> 42:45.500
It's nothing.

42:45.540 --> 42:46.480
From now on,

42:46.980 --> 42:48.840
you don't have to do these things.

42:49.750 --> 42:50.820
Let others do them.

42:55.980 --> 42:58.170
I should do these things.

42:58.500 --> 43:00.560
After all, I was selected by you as...

43:03.540 --> 43:05.000
I was selected by you as...

43:07.520 --> 43:08.660
As what?

43:13.890 --> 43:16.550
Sword Wielder, is there anything else you need?

43:20.020 --> 43:21.620
What's wrong with your eyes?

43:29.190 --> 43:30.650
When are you leaving?

43:33.260 --> 43:35.670
Three days later. It's the eighth day of the first lunar month.

43:35.670 --> 43:38.870
It's unsuitable to farm but suitable to go out on that day.

43:39.190 --> 43:40.900
Let me go with you.

43:41.140 --> 43:42.360
I can take care of you.

43:42.740 --> 43:43.940
I'm afraid you can't.

43:44.340 --> 43:46.460
The offspring of the Gong family who go for the trial

43:46.460 --> 43:49.390
can only bring their personal Green Jade guardians.

43:54.880 --> 43:56.570
Be careful, Sword Wielder.

44:54.430 --> 44:56.260
What went wrong?

44:57.370 --> 44:59.570
What went wrong?

44:59.870 --> 45:02.240
Tell me.

45:02.410 --> 45:04.570
Why?

45:20.010 --> 45:20.580
This is the room

45:20.580 --> 45:23.180
of Eldest Young Miss who likes doing research?

45:32.490 --> 45:35.420
The saltpeter produced too much smoke when burning.

45:35.490 --> 45:37.820
The amount of charcoal and sulfur was obviously too much.

45:37.820 --> 45:38.840
It burnt too fast,

45:39.340 --> 45:40.650
so it was easy to expand.

45:40.650 --> 45:41.270
Alright.

45:41.730 --> 45:43.330
You don't need to clean here.

45:44.980 --> 45:45.880
Yes, Eldest Young Miss.

45:45.880 --> 45:46.820
I'll leave now.

45:47.690 --> 45:48.240
Stop!

45:50.510 --> 45:51.910
What did you say just now?

45:53.810 --> 45:55.300
The saltpeter

45:55.610 --> 45:57.140
produced too much smoke when burning.

45:57.140 --> 45:59.580
The amount of charcoal and sulfur was obviously too much.

45:59.580 --> 46:00.840
It burnt too fast,

46:01.500 --> 46:02.830
so it was easy to expand.

46:05.900 --> 46:06.900
What's your name?

46:13.580 --> 46:14.340
Xiaohei.

46:15.570 --> 46:18.230
Who do you work for? Why do you know these things?

46:19.590 --> 46:21.190
My grandpa makes fireworks.

46:21.280 --> 46:22.540
He's really good at it.

46:22.620 --> 46:25.240
The fireworks made by my family were also set off in the capital city before.

46:25.240 --> 46:27.080
Alright. Stay here.

46:28.180 --> 46:28.980
To clean here?

46:30.620 --> 46:31.820
Let's play together.

46:40.310 --> 46:43.520
It's time to say goodbye.

46:45.140 --> 46:45.670
Enough.

46:46.270 --> 46:48.270
You two are heartless. Stop acting.

46:48.820 --> 46:50.770
It's okay for you to blame Jin Fan.

46:51.340 --> 46:52.200
Why

46:52.340 --> 46:53.470
do you also blame me?

46:57.840 --> 46:58.700
Sword Wielder.

46:59.080 --> 46:59.680
Remember,

47:00.660 --> 47:01.790
don't act tough.

47:04.690 --> 47:05.750
Young Master Ziyu.

47:06.600 --> 47:08.450
Let me go to the entrance to the back hill with you.

47:08.450 --> 47:08.980
-No.
-No.

47:10.630 --> 47:11.820
The back hill is an important place.

47:11.820 --> 47:13.480
Outsiders are not allowed in.

47:14.370 --> 47:15.510
The back hill is an important place.

47:15.510 --> 47:16.780
Irrelevant people are not allowed to get in.

47:16.780 --> 47:18.060
Irrelevant people are not allowed to get in.

47:18.060 --> 47:19.380
We don't know martial arts.

47:19.380 --> 47:20.980
We don't have many things to do.

47:20.980 --> 47:23.370
The back hill is dangerous and terrifying.

47:23.370 --> 47:24.200
Let him go

47:24.700 --> 47:25.960
and have an adventure.

47:28.500 --> 47:29.560
Young Master Ziyu.

47:30.970 --> 47:31.720
Take care.

47:33.720 --> 47:34.520
Wait for me.

48:16.710 --> 48:20.010
[Gong Residence, the Entrance to the Back Hill]

48:48.180 --> 48:48.800
Jin Fan.

48:49.460 --> 48:50.950
Did you practise handstands after breakfast again?

48:50.950 --> 48:51.880
You look so pale.

48:54.900 --> 48:55.430
Jin Fan.

48:56.460 --> 48:57.740
Do you know something

48:58.600 --> 49:00.600
about the Trial of the Three Realms?

49:04.350 --> 49:05.410
You're so nervous.

49:06.770 --> 49:09.170
Will Young Master Ziyu's life be in danger?

49:14.010 --> 49:14.940
You're so annoying.

49:14.940 --> 49:17.800
Even a mute is not as annoying as you. Say something.

49:18.240 --> 49:18.700
Jin Fan.

49:19.110 --> 49:20.310
I know you swore

49:20.550 --> 49:22.150
that you won't mention anything about the back hill.

49:22.150 --> 49:23.660
You don't have to say anything.

49:23.660 --> 49:25.380
Just nod or shake your head.

49:26.320 --> 49:28.120
It's not a violation of your vow.

49:33.440 --> 49:34.840
Will his life be in danger

49:34.990 --> 49:36.790
in the Trial of the Three Realms?

49:43.930 --> 49:44.640
Do you know

49:45.410 --> 49:46.790
what the first trial is?

49:48.660 --> 49:50.390
Does it test his intelligence?

49:53.090 --> 49:55.090
Does it test his martial art skills?

49:55.890 --> 49:58.690
Does it test his zero-gravity martial art skills?

50:10.880 --> 50:12.740
Does it test his internal skills?

50:15.620 --> 50:16.500
Zishang.

50:16.570 --> 50:17.130
Jin Fan.

50:17.660 --> 50:19.060
I need you to do me a favor.

50:19.370 --> 50:20.040
What is it?

50:20.580 --> 50:21.780
Help me to go to the back hill.

50:21.780 --> 50:23.740
Let me replace Jin Fan to protect Sword Wielder.

50:23.740 --> 50:24.430
No way.

50:26.170 --> 50:27.540
The back hill is an important place.

50:27.540 --> 50:28.460
Outsiders are not allowed in.

50:28.460 --> 50:28.860
Right?

50:30.370 --> 50:31.580
Irrelevant people are not allowed to get in.

50:31.580 --> 50:32.710
I'm not irrelevant.

50:33.100 --> 50:34.230
I'm not an outsider.

50:34.510 --> 50:37.170
I was selected by Lord Sword Wielder as his wife.

50:37.540 --> 50:40.340
Although I haven't officially married Sword Wielder,

50:40.340 --> 50:42.420
he's already my husband

50:44.730 --> 50:45.680
in my heart.

50:47.270 --> 50:47.780
Jin Fan.

50:48.420 --> 50:52.350
You just said his life will be in danger in the Trial of the Three Realms.

50:52.690 --> 50:54.770
If Young Master Ziyu dies in the trial,

50:54.770 --> 50:56.500
I won't live.

50:59.300 --> 51:00.870
But if he passes the trial,

51:01.660 --> 51:04.120
he'll be the legitimate Lord Sword Wielder.

51:04.860 --> 51:06.390
Is the wife of Sword Wielder

51:06.670 --> 51:08.470
eligible to enter the back hill?

51:08.720 --> 51:10.440
Dear, stop messing around.

51:10.470 --> 51:12.390
Even though you're not an outsider, you don't know martial arts.

51:12.390 --> 51:13.420
What can you do there?

51:13.420 --> 51:14.140
Jin Fan knows martial arts.

51:14.140 --> 51:16.200
He can protect Sword Wielder.

51:16.290 --> 51:16.760
If you go...

51:16.760 --> 51:18.320
What if I can defeat Jin Fan?

51:32.910 --> 51:33.790
Why are there

51:34.430 --> 51:35.960
many kinds of dishes today?

51:37.900 --> 51:38.850
The food is hot.

51:39.230 --> 51:41.250
You came just in time.

51:54.580 --> 51:55.780
Were all these dishes

51:56.340 --> 51:57.440
cooked by you?

52:00.160 --> 52:01.690
Don't mind if they look bad.

52:02.200 --> 52:03.400
They indeed look bad.

52:09.460 --> 52:10.330
What is this?

52:12.980 --> 52:13.980
It looks like

52:15.030 --> 52:15.820
a pheasant.

52:17.730 --> 52:20.540
I specially asked people from the kitchen to go up the mountain and hunt it.

52:20.540 --> 52:24.410
I removed the skin and bones and fried them once before putting it in a pan.

52:24.410 --> 52:27.340
The Shangguan family is distinguished in Dafu City.

52:27.460 --> 52:28.920
You're Eldest Young Miss.

52:29.100 --> 52:29.960
You know these?

52:30.690 --> 52:31.620
My mother said

52:32.380 --> 52:33.640
only women who can cook

52:34.660 --> 52:35.660
can keep people.

52:38.530 --> 52:39.190
Have a seat.

52:52.670 --> 52:56.270
Brother Yuanzhi, why don't you eat after Young Master Shangjue?

52:57.500 --> 52:58.700
My brother spoils me.

52:59.100 --> 53:01.760
He always lets me eat delicious food first.

53:01.980 --> 53:03.280
Although you're spoiled,

53:03.280 --> 53:05.240
you should have good manners.

53:05.660 --> 53:06.660
We're brothers.

53:07.280 --> 53:09.340
There is no need to stand on ceremony.

53:11.740 --> 53:12.550
I think

53:13.010 --> 53:14.110
Lord Sword Wielder

53:14.310 --> 53:15.800
is quite polite.

53:21.660 --> 53:23.460
That's why he's not our brother.

53:23.480 --> 53:24.410
What do you mean?

53:24.500 --> 53:25.860
And he's not Sword Wielder.

53:25.860 --> 53:26.420
Eat.

53:32.020 --> 53:34.150
Young Master Shangjue, help yourself.

53:34.150 --> 53:36.410
There's food in Brother Yuanzhi's bowl.

53:36.790 --> 53:37.520
Don't call me

53:37.540 --> 53:38.540
Brother Yuanzhi.

53:39.300 --> 53:41.630
Only my elder brother can call me brother.

53:44.130 --> 53:45.420
Aren't you polite?

53:46.170 --> 53:48.700
Then call me Young Master Yuanzhi from now on.

53:52.380 --> 53:53.580
After we get married,

53:53.850 --> 53:55.250
you can call him brother.

54:16.340 --> 54:17.870
My brother is a vegetarian.

54:18.170 --> 54:19.950
He eats stew at most.

54:20.860 --> 54:23.520
I'm afraid the dishes you cooked will be wasted.

54:25.580 --> 54:26.630
That's why

54:27.030 --> 54:30.430
Young Master Shangjue has a weak stomach and has no appetite.

54:30.740 --> 54:32.970
You grew up with Young Master Shangjue.

54:33.260 --> 54:35.060
He only eats one meal every day.

54:35.540 --> 54:37.140
Don't you feel sorry for him?

54:43.470 --> 54:44.430
I did wrong.

54:44.850 --> 54:46.110
Please punish me.

54:47.580 --> 54:48.090
Oh?

54:49.620 --> 54:50.820
What did you do wrong?

54:52.900 --> 54:53.710
It was my fault

54:54.620 --> 54:56.750
for speculating about your thoughts.

54:58.420 --> 54:59.520
What did you get?

55:01.560 --> 55:02.780
You

55:03.110 --> 55:04.230
only eat stew.

55:04.740 --> 55:06.800
You don't eat whole chicken and fish.

55:07.330 --> 55:07.940
I guess

55:09.110 --> 55:10.640
it's because of their eyes.

55:13.290 --> 55:14.820
My father once told me

55:15.620 --> 55:17.880
that soldiers who fight on battlefields

55:18.410 --> 55:19.340
seldom eat fish.

55:20.480 --> 55:21.810
Because the eyes of fish

55:22.370 --> 55:23.860
are the same

55:24.780 --> 55:26.040
as the eyes of the dead.

55:27.020 --> 55:28.470
All these years,

55:29.590 --> 55:32.130
you've been risking your life for the Gong family.

55:32.130 --> 55:33.930
You've seen many bloody scenes.

55:35.950 --> 55:36.730
Actually,

55:37.220 --> 55:38.230
you never said it,

55:39.540 --> 55:41.400
but you still have hard feelings.

55:42.890 --> 55:44.410
You know a lot.

55:54.520 --> 55:55.980
Aren't you giving it to me?

55:59.580 --> 56:00.710
Aren't you giving me

56:01.640 --> 56:03.500
the soup you ladled into the bowl?

56:12.340 --> 56:13.070
I want it too.

56:19.430 --> 56:20.360
Let her ladle it.

56:38.850 --> 56:40.370
[Yu]

56:54.000 --> 56:55.210
A competition between gentle people

56:55.210 --> 56:56.610
doesn't hurt each other.

56:59.900 --> 57:01.860
This is the knife used by guardians.

57:01.860 --> 57:03.300
It's a bit heavy

57:03.500 --> 57:04.200
for girls.

57:04.750 --> 57:05.810
It doesn't matter.

58:01.210 --> 58:01.740
Brother.

58:02.590 --> 58:04.520
Gong Ziyu has gone to the back hill.

58:06.710 --> 58:08.510
There is nothing to worry about.

58:11.220 --> 58:12.820
If he has self-awareness,

58:13.870 --> 58:15.200
he should give up early.

58:15.420 --> 58:17.420
If he doesn't have self-awareness,

58:18.240 --> 58:19.360
let's remind him.

58:20.080 --> 58:21.580
His shameful background.

58:21.940 --> 58:23.400
Do you know where to start?

58:26.270 --> 58:27.200
Miss Shangguan.

58:28.380 --> 58:29.840
I want a bowl of sweet soup.

58:30.330 --> 58:31.100
I wonder

58:31.380 --> 58:33.100
if there is some in the kitchen?

58:33.100 --> 58:33.530
Yes.

58:45.540 --> 58:46.250
Lady Lan.

58:47.200 --> 58:48.120
Lady Lan?

58:49.970 --> 58:51.300
Isn't she dead?

58:54.260 --> 58:55.690
Dead people can't speak,

58:56.940 --> 58:59.270
but people who are alive can speak for her.

59:00.140 --> 59:03.410
The personal servant who served Lady Lan when she was pregnant

59:03.410 --> 59:04.970
must know more than us.

59:55.300 --> 59:55.980
I won.

01:00:03.150 --> 01:00:03.730
Jin Fan.

01:00:06.570 --> 01:00:08.800
Although you battled with me with a knife,

01:00:08.800 --> 01:00:11.590
all your moves are the moves for using swords.

01:00:12.270 --> 01:00:14.700
I happen to know the sword technique you used.

01:00:14.700 --> 01:00:16.230
Qingfeng Nine Moves Sword.

01:00:16.810 --> 01:00:20.020
It's the Qingfeng Sect's secret top-class sword technique that hasn't been passed down.

01:00:20.020 --> 01:00:22.380
The Qingfeng Sect has joined the Wufeng.

01:00:22.920 --> 01:00:23.380
Tell me.

01:00:23.730 --> 01:00:24.950
What's your identity in the Qingfeng Sect?
